{"id": "97110108", "name": "גזירה פרמטרית – dy/dx או dx/dy כפונקציה של t", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>העקומה נתונה בהצגה פרמטרית:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ x(t)={{CT:0}},\\qquad y(t)={{CT:1}} \\]</p><p>[[if test=\"{{CT:2}}\"]]מצאו את \\(\\frac{dy}{dx}\\)[[else]]מצאו את \\(\\frac{dx}{dy}\\)[[/if]] כפונקציה של \\(t\\).</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[if test=\"{{CT:2}}\"]]\\( \\dfrac{dy}{dx}= \\)[[else]]\\( \\dfrac{dx}{dy}= \\)[[/if]] [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p class=\"input-hint\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:right\">איך מזינים: ביטוי ב-\\(t\\). את \\(e^{u}\\) מזינים <code dir=\"ltr\">exp(u)</code>, את \\(\\ln u\\) מזינים <code dir=\"ltr\">ln(u)</code>, וכפל מסמנים בכוכבית.</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> כאשר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y\\)</span> תלויים בפרמטר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(t\\)</span>, לפי כלל השרשרת <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{y'(t)}{x'(t)}\\)</span> בנקודות שבהן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x'(t)\\neq 0\\)</span>, ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\frac{dx}{dy}=\\frac{x'(t)}{y'(t)}\\)</span> בנקודות שבהן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y'(t)\\neq 0\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — הנגזרות לפי t</b><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ x'(t)={{CT:3}},\\qquad y'(t)={{CT:4}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — המנה</b><br>[[if test=\"{{CT:2}}\"]]<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{y'(t)}{x'(t)}=\\frac{ {{CT:4}} }{ {{CT:3}} }={{CT:5}} \\]</p>[[else]]<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\frac{dx}{dy}=\\frac{x'(t)}{y'(t)}=\\frac{ {{CT:3}} }{ {{CT:4}} }={{CT:5}} \\]</p>[[/if]]</div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 30, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "ta", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "1/ta", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">המנה הפוכה: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{y'(t)}{x'(t)}\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\frac{dx}{dy}=\\frac{x'(t)}{y'(t)}\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "-ta", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-3-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">בדקו את הסימנים בנגזרות של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x(t)\\)</span> ושל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y(t)\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "prt1-3-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 3, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "nm", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-4-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">זו רק הנגזרת של המונה. צריך לחלק אותה בנגזרת של הפונקציה השנייה לפי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(t\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-4-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["a1", "a2", "a3", "a4", "ask", "b3", "b4", "kd", "m1", "n1", "n2", "n4", "nm", "r3", "s3", "ta", "xp", "xt", "ypt", "yt"], "nvariants": 50}